# Design System

## Styling

- Tailwind CSS v4 only — global styles in `src/app/[locale]/globals.css`
- Merge classes with `cn()` from `@/lib/utils`
- Font: Noto Sans JP via `next/font` (already configured in root layout)
- No CSS modules, styled-components, or inline `<style>` tags

## Color Palette

| Role | Classes |
|------|---------|
| Page background | `bg-slate-50`, gradient via `--background-hero-gradient` |
| Cards / panels | `bg-white rounded-lg border border-slate-200 shadow-sm` |
| Primary action | `bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-700 text-white` |
| Body text | `text-slate-900`, `text-slate-800` |
| Muted text | `text-slate-500`, `text-xs` for labels |
| Links | `text-blue-600 hover:underline` |
| Danger | `text-red-500`, `bg-red-600` |
| Table headers | `bg-slate-50 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-500` |

## UI Primitives (`src/components/ui/`)

Each primitive lives in its own folder:

```
src/components/ui/{name}/
  {name}.tsx
  {name}.test.tsx   # optional, colocated
  index.ts          # re-exports
```

Existing primitives: `Button`, `Input`, `Select`, `Switch`, `Textarea`.

### Button API

```tsx
<Button variant="solid|outline|ghost" color="primary|secondary|danger|neutral"
        size="sm|md|lg" loading icon iconPosition="left|right">
```

Always prefer `Button` over raw `<button>` for actions. Use raw buttons only for legacy markup being migrated.

### Input API

Import from `@/components/ui/input` or `@/components/ui`. Supports standard HTML input props + `cn` merging.

## Icons

Use `react-icons` — import per icon: `import { AiOutlineHome } from "react-icons/ai"`.

## Layouts

Role layouts live in `src/components/layouts/{role}_layout/`. They wrap `AppLayout` with translated sidebar config. Do NOT duplicate sidebar markup in features.

## Accessibility

- Form fields: associate labels via `FormLabel` + `id`
- Buttons: `aria-busy` when loading (Button handles this)
- Invalid fields: `aria-invalid` (FormInput handles this)
- Prefer `getByRole` selectors in tests

## Refusals

- Do NOT add shadcn, Radix wrappers, or duplicate existing UI primitives.
- Do NOT use arbitrary hex colors when Tailwind slate/blue palette applies.
- Do NOT import `next/link` — use `@/i18n/navigation` Link.
